                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Editorial Note</hi>
                </head>
                <p>At the end of October a paper entitled “United States Policy With Respect to
                    Berlin and Eastern Germany” was submitted to the National Security Council,
                    becoming NSC 89 on October 20. Regarding this
                    paper, see the Paper prepared by McCloy and others, August 29, <ref
                        target="#pg867">page 867</ref>.</p>
            </div>
